Internationalise the experiment init-config editor (InitConfigApp).

Upstream's init_config.json visual editor is the only extension webview with
hard-coded Chinese labels; route them through the webviews' existing i18next
setup and add matching en-US and zh-CN strings. Applied by the web build
(services/web/upstream-patches.ts); suitable for contributing upstream.

